      "a_s02-old0": {
        "id": "a_s02-old0",
        "message": {
          "id": "a_s02-old0",
          "author": {
            "role": "user",
            "name": null,
            "metadata": {}
          },
          "create_time": 1788782400.0,
          "update_time": null,
          "content": {
            "content_type": "text",
            "parts": [
              "ABANDONED-BRANCH: is 60% mislocalization enough to publish?"
            ]
          },
          "status": "finished_successfully",
          "end_turn": null,
          "weight": 1.0,
          "metadata": {},
          "recipient": "all"
        },
        "parent": "a_s02-sys",
        "children": [
          "a_s02-old1"
        ]
      },
      "a_s02-old1": {
        "id": "a_s02-old1",
        "message": {
          "id": "a_s02-old1",
          "author": {
            "role": "assistant",
            "name": null,
            "metadata": {}
          },
          "create_time": 1788782430.0,
          "update_time": null,
          "content": {
            "content_type": "text",
            "parts": [
              "ABANDONED-BRANCH: probably not without a functional readout."
            ]
          },
          "status": "finished_successfully",
          "end_turn": true,
          "weight": 1.0,
          "metadata": {},
          "recipient": "all"
        },
        "parent": "a_s02-old0",
        "children": []
      },
      "a_s02-m00": {
        "id": "a_s02-m00",
        "message": {
          "id": "a_s02-m00",
          "author": {
            "role": "user",
            "name": null,
            "metadata": {}
          },
          "create_time": 1788783000.0,
          "update_time": null,
          "content": {
            "content_type": "text",
            "parts": [
              "Our immunofluorescence shows mislocalization in about 60% of Disease A cells versus 15% of controls. Does that tell us anything about function, or only about location?"
            ]
          },
          "status": "finished_successfully",
          "end_turn": null,
          "weight": 1.0,
          "metadata": {},
          "recipient": "all"
        },
        "parent": "a_s02-sys",
        "children": [
          "a_s02-m01"
        ]
      },
      "a_s02-m01": {
        "id": "a_s02-m01",
        "message": {
          "id": "a_s02-m01",
          "author": {
            "role": "assistant",
            "name": null,
            "metadata": {}
          },
          "create_time": 1788783060.0,
          "update_time": null,
          "content": {
            "content_type": "text",
            "parts": [
              "On its own it tells you about location. A protein can be in an unusual place and still work, or look normal and be impaired. To link location to the phenotype you need a functional readout: for example, a cargo-uptake measurement, a pulse-chase to follow delivery over time, or surface labelling to quantify how much arrives."
            ]
          },
          "status": "finished_successfully",
          "end_turn": true,
          "weight": 1.0,
          "metadata": {},
          "recipient": "all"
        },
        "parent": "a_s02-m00",
        "children": [
          "a_s02-m02"
        ]
      },
      "a_s02-m02": {
        "id": "a_s02-m02",
        "message": {
          "id": "a_s02-m02",
          "author": {
            "role": "user",
            "name": null,
            "metadata": {}
          },
          "create_time": 1788783120.0,
          "update_time": null,
          "content": {
            "content_type": "text",
            "parts": [
              "We've only ever done imaging. I'm not sure which functional measurement fits our question, or how to tell a real effect from an artifact of the assay itself."
            ]
          },
          "status": "finished_successfully",
          "end_turn": null,
          "weight": 1.0,
          "metadata": {},
          "recipient": "all"
        },
        "parent": "a_s02-m01",
        "children": [
          "a_s02-m03"
        ]
      },
      "a_s02-m03": {
        "id": "a_s02-m03",
        "message": {
          "id": "a_s02-m03",
          "author": {
            "role": "assistant",
            "name": null,
            "metadata": {}
          },
          "create_time": 1788783180.0,
          "update_time": null,
          "content": {
            "content_type": "text",
            "parts": [
              "That's the key gap: picking a functional readout that matches the hypothesis, with controls that rule out artifacts. Someone who has designed trafficking assays before would help you choose."
            ]
          },
          "status": "finished_successfully",
          "end_turn": true,
          "weight": 1.0,
          "metadata": {},
          "recipient": "all"
        },
        "parent": "a_s02-m02",
        "children": []
      }
    },
    "moderation_results": [],
    "current_node": "a_s02-m03",
    "conversation_id": "a_s02",
    "id": "a_s02"
